senses.gloss:
--a तीर्थ (lake) encircled by the R. Saras- वती at the foot of the Gaura hill; विष्णु let flow drops of joy- ful tears at the place and hence the name; here Kardama awaited Manu and his daughter; its trees, plants and birds;
1: भा. III. २१. ३३-44.
Kapila's residence;
2: Ib. III. २५. 5.
sacred to Hari;
3: Ib. VII. १४. ३१.
visited by बलराम;
4: Ib. X. ७८. १९.
celebrated for भगीरथ's penance;
5: Br. II. १८. २५ and ३१.
the seven streams of the गङ्गा originate here: formed of drops (bindu) of गङ्गा fallen in anger from the locks of शिव where she was im- prisoned; Indra performed many sacrifices here.
6: M. १२१. २६-42; वा. ४७. २४, ३० and ४१.
